Package: tines
Type: Package
Title: Building the Prongs of Your Forking Paths
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "H. Sherry", "Zhang",
      email = "huizezhangsh@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")
    )
  )
Description: Tools for documenting analytical decisions in data analysis.
    Analytical decisions are documented as a schema of steps, and large
    language models are used to generate and validate R code. Schemas can be
    expanded with alternative decisions into a multiverse of analyses,
    allowing analysts to explore how their conclusions depend on the
    analytical choices they made.
